# Provider plugin cache / working directory. Large, machine-specific
# binaries -- must never be committed.
.terraform/

# Generic Terraform crash/override artifacts.
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Plan output files, if anyone ever saves one locally.
*.tfplan

# NOTE: terraform.tfstate and terraform.tfstate.backup are intentionally
# NOT ignored here. This bootstrap config's state is committed to the repo
# on purpose -- see "Don't lose this state file" in README.md. Do not add
# a blanket `*.tfstate` rule to this file; that would silently undo that
# decision.
